{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此人字指學人而言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此法字指宗師之法而言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前五路不得行，行即錯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "䖍乃石霜侍者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不同臨濟賓主，臨濟就師資而言，此就體用而言。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滲不停水，漏不盛物，故名滲漏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欲分清共濁，當辨印和風。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正不坐正，偏不垂偏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此見曹山錄中，非仰山語。因前收在溈仰宗，故不欲移動也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "載祖庭事苑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然燈前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然燈後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正然燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方員任器，頭角全彰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "體用互收，名言不立"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隱顯無私，旁通者畔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "動止因三種，偏枯落二邊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疑情猶未盡，回首到家遲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "密嗣門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X65n1282_p0258a18"}
